Subject: [PATCH 10/10] README: branch changelog; opendbc_repo bump to 6cbc8005
 (README only)

Replace the first fork note with a full list of what this branch changes
on top of v0.9.9 (11 commits), the opendbc fork branch it consumes, the
audits that were run and the platform-level divergences deliberately not
ported. The opendbc bump only brings the matching README changelog.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
